MFLOW 2
NAME Circuit: conveyor line
POPUP 1 2 2 How it works
POPUPTEXT 1 SB1 starts KM2: the belt runs. T1 (3 s) then\ncloses KM1: drive U1 runs the roller\nconveyor at 70%. Sand rides both conveyors\ninto the bucket. SB0 / ES1 stop the line.
POPUP 2 0 3 Try this
POPUPTEXT 2 Hold SB1: the belt first, then the rollers.\nChange U1's speed in Properties.\nFault Belt01: OL2 stops the whole line.

